            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "Mrluke007\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam41 contributions\n0\nLove this place, but gotta pick up their drink service game!\nApr 2017 • Couples\nThis place is awesome, it's like a sushi train style japanese hotpot joint. You get to choose what kind of soup you want and then as it boils on a hotplate in front of you pick from plethora of ingredients to cook and eat. Great for vegans to flat out total carnivores. You can add all sorts of noodles, veg, meat, seafood and even frog if you like that sort of thing. I don't mind a bit of bbq frog but I'm yet to try cooking it myself. Anyway top notch place, totally recommend!!\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2017",
