            "review_text": "Brian L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam267 contributions\n0\nIndividual Hotpot restaurant with conveyer belt selection service\nJan 2017 • Friends\nAbout a week ago I went with friends to this restaurant in Vincom Centre, Le Thanh Ton Street, and it seems that such a dining experience is all the rage in Vietnam. Everybody gets their own pot of broth, 4 kinds to chose from, and then you just prepare your own meal with the plated ingredients from the conveyer belt or you can ask for the plated meats that are also available. My broth was the spicy one and it is somewhat spicy! For an additional payment you can have also the buffet which offers a simple selection of sushi, but to take this option everybody in the group has to take it so paying for one and sharing for all is not an possible.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 14, 2017",
