            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "G-and-Jo-on-the-go\nLos Angeles, California68 contributions\n0\nPerfect for parties with different dietary restrictions\nNov 2015 • Friends\nYummy all-you-can-eat spot. We have tried two Kichi Kichi locations. This one and the one in Danang at the Vincom center. This location had the added bonus of a sushi bar.\n\nWe recommend sitting at the \"bar\" where the conveyor belt is. The benefit is each individual gets their own soup pot. This is helpful especially if your party has different dietary restrictions (e.g. vegetarian, non-pork eaters, allergic to seafood.\n\nThe Tom Yum soup base is our fave flavor of the three choices.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 21, 2015",
